src/cpus/cpu_mips_instr_loadstore.c:29: *  
src/cpus/cpu_mips_instr_loadstore.c:30: *  arg[0] = pointer to the register to load to or store from
src/cpus/cpu_mips_instr_loadstore.c:31: *  arg[1] = pointer to the base register
