src/cpus/cpu_mips_instr_loadstore.c:37: *  The quick function is included twice (big/little endian) for each
src/cpus/cpu_mips_instr_loadstore.c:38: *  GENERIC function.
src/cpus/cpu_mips_instr_loadstore.c:39: */
